Mockup Description for Map Screen (Version 1 – Basic Layout)

This is a basic wireframe of the Map Screen for Travel Map Discovery App.

Layout:

Top: Search bar with category filters (food, attractions, photo spots)
Center: Interactive map with location pins
Bottom: Navigation bar (Home, Saved, Profile)

Hierarchy:

Primary: Map with pins
Secondary: Filters and navigation bar

Usability:

Easy navigation with bottom bar
Clickable pins show place details
Clean layout for quick exploration